# Optional. When set, the Contact page renders a custom-styled Google Map
# (via the Maps JavaScript API) showing only the clinic's own marker,
# instead of the default embed which shows every nearby business's icon.
# Get a key at https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis with the
# "Maps JavaScript API" enabled, then copy this file to .env.local and
# fill in the value.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
